    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e325">garadh ùir</headword>
      <description>turf dyke a further ½ mile into the moor (one mile from sea). This dyke protected the cultivation of the river glen. In vicinity of each of these dykes was a pound for stray animals.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="d0e334">garadh droma</headword>
    </item>
    <item>
